{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_31_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，王二月，葬陳莊公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"二、夏，公子慶父帥師伐於餘丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"國而曰伐。於餘丘，邾之邑也。其曰伐何也？公子貴矣，師重矣，而敵人之邑，公子病矣。病公子，所以譏乎公也。其一曰，君在而重之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，齊王姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"為之主者，卒之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，夫人姜氏會齊侯於禚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁，不踰竟。踰竟，非正也。婦人不言會，言會，非正也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_31_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_31","textTraditional":"五、乙酉，宋公馮卒。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}